"entity": {
"name": "Schaeffler AG",
"description": "Schaeffler AG operates as a holding company, which engages in the supply of products and solutions for the automotive and industrial sectors. It operates through the following segments: Automotive Technologies, and Automotive Aftermarket & Industrial. The Automotive Technologies segment organizes its business in the Engine & Transmission Systems, Bearings, and Chassis Systems business divisions. The Automotive Aftermarket & Industrial segment focuses on Europe, Americas, Greater China, and Asia/Pacific regions. The company was founded by Georg Schaeffler and Wilhelm Schaeffler in 1946 and is headquartered in Herzogenaurach, Germany.",
